.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ag-git-import 1  "import 0.2.0-rc.2" 
.SH NAME
ag\-git\-import \- Import a Git repository\*(Aqs history into a new stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag git import\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-rev\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-stream\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import a Git repository\*(Aqs history into a new stream
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-rev\fR \fI<REV>\fR [default: HEAD]
Revision to import
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-stream\fR \fI<STREAM>\fR [default: imported]
Stream to create for the imported history
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
Path of the Git repository
.SH VERSION
v0.2.0\-rc.2
